#: ../../source/agent/index.rst:2
msgid "Use the Daedalus Agent"
msgstr "使用 Daedalus Agent"

#: ../../source/agent/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"Studio gives the agent a controlled path from a request to a reviewable "
"project result."
msgstr "Studio 为 agent 提供了一条受控路径，让请求最终形成可审查的项目结果。"

#: ../../source/agent/index.rst:17
msgid ""
"The agent can answer directly, inspect a project, propose a plan, edit "
"files, run verification, and report evidence. It is not a replacement for"
" your code review: use the timeline and Git diff to decide whether the "
"result is correct."
msgstr "agent 可以直接回答问题、检查项目、提议计划、编辑文件、运行验证并报告证据。它不能替代你的代码审查：请使用时间线和 Git diff 判断结果是否正确。"
